、左衛、太常。劉裕伐姚泓，請為諮議參軍。裕將弱王室，誣其罪害之。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-064-simapeng:p001:m0042","object_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-064-simapeng:p001:m0030"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"承上文和；太元中復國之後記和薨。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false}],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-064-simadaosheng:p001:m0156","surface":"梁王珍之","start":156,"end":160,"person_id":"hxp_cd6_qcl","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-064-simadaosheng:p001","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-064-simadaosheng"},{"id":"c-jinshu-064-simapeng:p001:m0042","surface":"珍之","start":42,"end":44,"person_id":"hxp_cd6_qcl","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-064-simapeng:p001","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-064-simapeng"},{"id":"c-jinshu-064-simapeng:p001:m0083","surface":"梁王珍之","start":83,"end":87,"person_id":"hxp_cd6_qcl","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-064-simapeng:p001","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-064-simapeng"}],"relations":[{"id":"a-jin064-zhenzhi-father","subject_person_id":"hxp_cd6_qcl","object_person_id":"066_2n0_0po","predicate":"father","qualifiers":{"source_term":"薨，子珍之嗣"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-064","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-064-simapeng","source_id":"s-jinshu-064-simapeng-ws2622004","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-064-simapeng:p001","quote":"梁王㻱，字賢明，出繼梁王翹，官至永安太僕，與父晞俱廢。薨，子和嗣。太元中復國。薨，子珍之嗣。桓玄篡位，國人孔樸奉珍之奔于壽陽。桓玄敗，珍之歸朝廷。太將軍武陵王令曰：「梁王珍之理悟貞立，蒙險違難，撫義懷順，載奔闕庭。值壽陽擾亂，在危克固，且可通直散騎郎。」累遷遊擊將軍、左衛、太常。劉裕伐姚泓，請為諮議參軍。裕將弱王室，誣其罪害之。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-064-simapeng:p001:m0042","object_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-064-simapeng:p001:m0030"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"承上文和；太元中復國之後記和薨。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false}],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-jinshu-064-simadaosheng:p001","text":"會稽思世子道生，字延長。帝為會稽王，立道生為世子，拜散騎侍郎、給事中。性疏躁，不修行業，多失禮度，竟以幽廢而卒，時年二十四，無後。及孝武帝即位，嘗晝日見道生及臨川獻王郁，鬱曰：「大郎饑乏辛苦。」言竟不見。帝傷感，因以西陽王錄玄孫珣之為後。珣之曆吳興太守。劉裕之伐關中，以為諮議參軍。時帝道方謝，珣之為宗室之美，與梁王珍之俱被害。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":106,"last_line":106,"raw_start":7099,"raw_end":7265,"raw_character_offsets":[7101,7102,7103,7104,7105,7106,7107,7108,7109,7110,7111,7112,7113,7114,7115,7116,7117,7118,7119,7120,7121,7122,7123,7124,7125,7126,7127,7128,7129,7130,7131,7132,7133,7134,7135,7136,7137,7138,7139,7140,7141,7142,7143,7144,7145,7146,7147,7148,7149,7150,7151,7152,7153,7154,7155,7156,7157,7158,7159,7160,7161,7162,7163,7164,7165,7166,7167,7168,7169,7170,7171,7172,7173,7174,7175,7176,7177,7178,7179,7180,7181,7182,7183,7184,7185,7186,7187,7188,7189,7190,7191,7192,7193,7194,7195,7196,7197,7198,7199,7200,7201,7202,7203,7204,7205,7206,7207,7208,7209,7210,7211,7212,7213,7214,7215,7216,7217,7218,7219,7220,7221,7222,7223,7224,7225,7226,7227,7228,7229,7230,7231,7232,7233,7234,7235,7236,7237,7238,7239,7240,7241,7242,7243,7244,7245,7246,7247,7248,7249,7250,7251,7252,7253,7254,7255,7256,7257,7258,7259,7260,7261,7262,7263,7264],"revision_id":2622004},"mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-064-simadaosheng:p001:m0000","surface":"會稽思世子道生","start":0,"end":7,"person_id":"k9q_h4e_j2q","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-064-simadaosheng:p001:m0066","surface":"孝武帝","start":66,"end":69,"person_id":"uke_dff_yrf","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-064-simadaosheng:p001:m0079","surface":"臨川獻王郁","start":79,"end":84,"person_id":"70z_zog_t15","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-064-simadaosheng:p001:m0111","surface":"錄","start